'''The Green Belt''' is an area of the eastern [[Wetlands]] where the trees and shrubs grow especially thick and where swamp flowers bloom all year around. [[Rethiel the Greenwarden]] makes his home here behind a hill, and where he treads, plants spring to life and blossoms flourish. The Green Belt is also home to [[crocolisk]]s, [[bog beast]]s, and [[ooze]]s.

